#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:5
#: 308dab2b8e74476997de398819feebaa 70a04aa4734b4e7caff01c5b24d0e8a3
#: a74186bf22ea46cf850ded9384565d5a ee7c590260e143c1b373cff53c849558
msgid "MAVLink Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "MAVLink 高级配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:8
#: 03dcc7810f5f488aac86d607df01a639 5ede0324c8a14bdcb45566e803a9439a
#: f2a9caaad621434ca98f93cfeeabd40c f2c0966c65244abda03cea0c0d4e809f
msgid ""
"Most users never have to change these parameters from their default values."
msgstr "大多数用户从不需要更改这些参数的默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:10
#: 736e0f7801464ede886a873d349b0fbb c33a4a547f3b4263940f35280d7e0563
#: e42340a43f364382b4c7e2a8f7bd8c7d f142ff6441894cb0ae2019636f69199c
msgid ""
"If a serial port protocol is set to MAVLink (``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` == 1 or "
"2), then advance configuration options can be set. The first serial port to "
"have the protocol uses the ``MAV1_`` parameters (often the USB port on "
"``SERIAL0``), the second port will be ``MAV2_``. etc."
msgstr ""
"如果某个串口的协议被设为 MAVLink（``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` == 1 或 "
"2），则可以设置高级配置选项。第一个使用该协议的串口使用 ``MAV1_`` 参数（通常是 ``SERIAL0`` 上的 USB 端口），第二个端口则为"
" ``MAV2_``，依此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:13
#: 430a4ef3d9e447309636b8059ddb22a7 77d5cf30aa144b87beec6f9d998354d4
#: 8979946ca1de41b8a6af9779d217ed2d 977adb3cdd8547d0a37aea0ae36b5926
msgid "STREAM RATES"
msgstr "数据流速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:14
#: 0137efaaa6e7407da5d39364fafe1308 06356e8e01cc499c80e498831567b098
#: 1add34e1961b41029af74650b81066d6 ea9bce82a50b4fbda1e953c7d359c626
msgid ""
"The following stream rate parameters can be set for each instance of a "
"MAVLink using serial port to determine how fast data is sent over the "
"port(SERIAL1 will be used in the following as an example)"
msgstr "对于每个使用 MAVLink 的串口实例，都可以设置以下流速率参数，以决定数据通过该端口发送的速度（下文以 SERIAL1 为例）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:17
#: 078b5807208949afafd6977a9177e9a3 12b5210f76b546ce91d1fcc1caf921a9
#: ae0e0effe8d542798c56b1130cbc76d7 c0e433a05f234b92a8e4939f2fdf97ce
msgid ":ref:`MAV1_ADSB<MAV1_ADSB>`: ADSB stream rate"
msgstr ":ref:`MAV1_ADSB<MAV1_ADSB>`：ADSB 流速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:18
#: 0a01026e63eb4e749ed759755a241cd9 6bd798987dc04ffa887b7ea019d75209
#: 6d39ddd1fc6a4abc84293ac0e877aea1 ab79bb80b57f4fbd8e3238447b118760
msgid ""
":ref:`MAV1_EXT_STAT<MAV1_EXT_STAT>`: MAVLink Stream rate of SYS_STATUS, "
"POWER_STATUS, MCU_STATUS, MEMINFO, CURRENT_WAYPOINT, GPS_RAW_INT, GPS_RTK "
"(if available), GPS2_RAW_INT (if available), GPS2_RTK (if available), "
"NAV_CONTROLLER_OUTPUT, FENCE_STATUS, and GLOBAL_TARGET_POS_INT"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAV1_EXT_STAT<MAV1_EXT_STAT>`：SYS_STATUS、POWER_STATUS、MCU_STATUS、MEMINFO、CURRENT_WAYPOINT、GPS_RAW_INT、GPS_RTK（如可用）、GPS2_RAW_INT（如可用）、GPS2_RTK（如可用）、NAV_CONTROLLER_OUTPUT、FENCE_STATUS"
" 和 GLOBAL_TARGET_POS_INT 的 MAVLink 流速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:19
#: 38c1f8fa6afd4bc6ba80dbd0559a2da8 5207e43e80034ba899767bd1575a3994
#: 547696d6191541378b6bb6296910b95f 70bdcaf67e8d4898ab4d448788af2d5a
msgid ""
":ref:`MAV1_EXTRA1<MAV1_EXTRA1>`: MAVLink Stream rate of ATTITUDE, SIMSTATE "
"(SIM only), AHRS2, RPM, AOA_SSA, LANDING,ESC_TELEMETRY,EFI_STATUS, and "
"PID_TUNING"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAV1_EXTRA1<MAV1_EXTRA1>`：ATTITUDE、SIMSTATE（仅 "
"SIM）、AHRS2、RPM、AOA_SSA、LANDING、ESC_TELEMETRY、EFI_STATUS 和 PID_TUNING 的 "
"MAVLink 流速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:20
