"other than the expected GCS system ID will be accepted"
msgstr ":ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID<MAV_GCS_SYSID>`：控制是否接受来自非预期 GCS 系统 ID 的数据包"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:42
