":ref:`MAV_OPTIONS<MAV_OPTIONS>`: Alters various behaviour of the MAVLink "
"interface. See table below. If bit 0 is set, the the channel will accetp "
"only MAVLink messages for the SYSID_GCS."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAV_OPTIONS<MAV_OPTIONS>`：改变 MAVLink 接口的多种行为。见下表。若 bit 0 置位，该通道将只接受发给 "
"SYSID_GCS 的 MAVLink 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:43
#: 14e02a658cce4559a45dceec394402a3 49911df7a31748fb92a01b7b44250995
#: d4d1c8a1d020430fb5664ba531d75f63 eff8d33eb7354b2c84e0fe684d6e558a
