"for this vehicle to distinguish it from others on the same network"
msgstr ":ref:`MAV_SYSID<MAV_SYSID>`：允许为本载具设置单独的 MAVLink 系统 ID，以便与同一网络中的其他载具区分"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-configuration.rst:44
