"delay radio telemetry to prevent an Xbee bricking on power up"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAV_TELEM_DELAY<MAV_TELEM_DELAY>`：延迟电台数传的时间量（单位为秒），以防止 Xbee 在上电时变砖"
